{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/extras/sanctuaryroses_tboai.jpg?t=1743717799\" />Explore the echoes of a world similar to our own, but one that suffers from the very real threat of Neural Demonic Phenomenae. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you venture into the world of The Blessing of Airon, there are items around every corner that tell the story of this seemingly quiet community. In many ways, their world is like our own... but in many ways it is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why are its people so frightened, superstitious even, about &quot;electronics&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Should you yourself be frightened?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspect a wide variety of objects, find notes for your journal, solve puzzles and explore areas filled with rich story details to unravel the mystery of this unique world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First Person view mode and inspection mode allow you to get up close and personal with the items that tell the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxed pace that favors those who take their time to closely inspect the finer details of their surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A setting that is eerily like an American rural mid-western church community, but somehow not at the same time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of inspectable, collectable and even reactive objects that can alter your surroundings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611900/extras/parsonage01_tboai.jpg?t=1743717799\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611900?t=1743717799","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611900?t=17